== adults in Lima or Oslo ==
  Sort users.age DESC, users.name
    Filter (users.age >= 30 AND (users.city = Lima OR users.city = Oslo))
      Scan users (12 rows)
users.id | users.name | users.city | users.age
      11 | kai        | Oslo       |        48
       6 | fay        | Oslo       |        33
== index lookup ==
  Project users.name, users.age
    IndexLookup users.city = Pune
users.name | users.age
bo         |        31
gus        |        46
liv        |        61
== hash join ==
  Limit 5
    Sort orders.amount DESC
      HashJoin orders.uid = users.id
        Scan orders (60 rows)
        Scan users (12 rows)
