== revenue by city ==
  Sort sum(orders.amount) DESC
    Aggregate group=[6] aggs=[(Count, 0), (Sum, 2), (Avg, 2), (Max, 7)]
      HashJoin orders.uid = users.id
        Scan orders (60 rows)
        Scan users (12 rows)
